id=axion_spsm
name=Axion Super Power Saving
version=v3.8.0
versionCode=71
author=Axion SPSM
description=v3.8.0, the architecture round: measured where the phone's time actually went and removed it. Package-manager work is batched - one pm call per forty packages instead of one fork per app (86 forks per session cycle became 4 on a 40-app phone; roughly 370 fewer forks on a 190-app phone); the daemon now naps with a read-timeout on its own pipe instead of forking sleep every tick (86400 forks a day became zero); the memory sweep no longer re-tells ActivityManager what it was told seconds ago. No feature, option, default, recovery path or workaround changed. Suite: 637 checks, 0 failed.
